<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Token Launch Radar - pre-token protocols ranked by implied value</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="app.css">
</head>
<body>
<header class="masthead">
  <div class="masthead-in">
    <p class="kicker">Token Launch Radar</p>
    <h1>Protocols with no token yet,<br>ranked by what a launch could be worth.</h1>
    <p class="standfirst">A sealed DefiLlama snapshot of <span id="as-of">2026-11-14</span>, priced by one
      stated model. The board ranks every pre-token protocol the snapshot supports;
      protocols whose token already trades are kept apart, at the market's own values.</p>
    <dl class="stats" id="stats"></dl>
    <p class="formula"><span class="formula-label">The model</span>
      <span class="formula-body">implied value = category multiple &times; TVL &times; scale &times; growth &times; maturity</span>
      <span class="formula-note">model <span id="model-id">radar-comps-1</span> - Category Comps with Sublinear TVL. Open any row for its working.</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section id="board-view">
    <div class="controls">
      <label class="ctl ctl-search">Search
        <input id="q" type="search" placeholder="name or slug" autocomplete="off">
      </label>
      <label class="ctl">Category
        <select id="cat"></select>
      </label>
      <label class="ctl">Chain
        <select id="chain"></select>
      </label>
      <label class="ctl ctl-check">
        <input id="watch-only" type="checkbox"> House watchlist only
      </label>
      <label class="ctl ctl-check">
        <input id="floor-only" type="checkbox"> Above the $50M floor
      </label>
      <p class="count" id="count"></p>
    </div>

    <table class="board" id="board">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th data-sort="rank" class="num sortable">Rank</th>
          <th data-sort="name" class="sortable">Protocol</th>
          <th>Category</th>
          <th>Chains</th>
          <th data-sort="tvl" class="num sortable">TVL</th>
          <th data-sort="change" class="num sortable">7d %</th>
          <th data-sort="age" class="num sortable">Age</th>
          <th data-sort="multiple" class="num sortable">Multiple</th>
          <th data-sort="implied" class="num sortable">Implied value</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody id="rows"></tbody>
    </table>
    <p class="empty" id="empty" hidden>No protocol matches those filters. Loosen one and the board comes back.</p>

    <section class="live">
      <h2>Already trading</h2>
      <p class="live-note">The snapshot's tokenised protocols are not ranked by the model. The largest by
        market cap, at the market's own values - the comparables the category multiples are built from.</p>
      <div class="live-grid" id="live"></div>
    </section>
  </section>

  <section id="detail-view" hidden>
    <p><a class="back" href="#/">&larr; Back to the board</a></p>
    <div id="detail"></div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  <p>Static page. It renders the sealed snapshot only - no live data, nothing fetched.
    Implied values follow from the snapshot's own figures (TVL, seven-day change, tracking age,
    category comparables); they are a model's reading of the record, not a promise of a launch.
    Farm plans are written per protocol from its category, chains, size and age.</p>
</footer>

<script src="../dashboard-data.js"></script>
<script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
```
